<title>POLAND: Mostostal-W gets PLN 19 mln deal.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-W gets PLN 19 mln deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Mostostal-Warszawa SA said in a Monady statement it received a 19 million zloty contract to build production facilities, which will be finished in March 1998.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
